; ============================================================
; AUTHENTICATED SHADOW ECONOMIC THRESHOLD ABI
; ============================================================
;
; DIRECT donor values from ShadowSource.per. These are not a
; four-resource strategic reserve vector. Escrow thresholds are
; actively consumed by Shadow progression/production rules.
;
; Castle/Imperial CA-/IA- thresholds are preserved as donor
; constants but are currently UNCONSUMED in ShadowSource.per.
; Do not promote them into active Byzantine policy without a new
; source-backed consumer.

